examples:
未引入基类重载时，可表示为：
```cpp
class Base {
public:
    virtual void overload();
    virtual void overload(int);
};

class Derived : public Base {
public:
    void overload() override;
};

Derived d;
d.overload(2); // 由于 Derived::overload 隐藏了同名基类重载，可能无法匹配

Base& ref = d;
ref.overload(7); // 可访问 Base::overload(int)
```

只想保留基类其他重载并重写无参数版本时：
```cpp
class Derived : public Base {
public:
    using Base::overload;
    void overload() override;
};
```
